# Summary

The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter. [[cite:obs-6910cf31c1f9fa2787f12327d222b6fc4c170752 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

The annex specifies the ordinary contribution amount: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January. [[cite:obs-5b6568d2726ce7ec0f9ae1ffeb2ba66922e16963 "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]
